<title>USA: A.H. Belo acquires St. Louis TV station.</title>
<headline>A.H. Belo acquires St. Louis TV station.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.H. Belo Corp said it has acquired St. Louis television station KMOV-TV, an affiliate of the CBS network, from Paramount Stations Group Inc.</p>
<p>The acquisition is part of an agreement reached February 20 to exchange the station for Belo's UPN affiliate KIRO-TV in Seattle-Tacoma, Wash., in a three-way exchange.</p>
<p>The value of the deal was not disclosed.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
